 align="left">hypothetical protein</td><td align="center">8.00</td><td align="center">3.05E-02</td></tr><tr><td align="left">167.m00116_x_at</td><td align="left"><ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="XM_646306">XM_646306</ext-link></td><td align="left">hypothetical protein</td><td align="center">7.98</td><td align="center">3.77E-03</td></tr><tr><td align="left">621.m00019_at</td><td align="left"><ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="XM_642928">XM_642928</ext-link></td><td align="left">hypothetical protein</td><td align="center">7.84</td><td align="center">8.57E-06</td></tr><tr><td align="left">584.m00019_at</td><td align="left"><ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="XM_642979">XM_642979</ext-link></td><td align="left"><italic>heat shock protein 70, putative</italic></td><td align="center">7.82</td><td align="center">5.54E-06</td></tr><tr><td align="left">477.m00021_at</td><td align="left"><ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="XM_643239">XM_643239</ext-link></td><td align="left">hypothetical protein</td><td align="center">7.60</td><td align="center">1.27E-03</td></tr><tr><td align="left">123.m00123_x_at</td><td align="left"><ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="XM_647209">XM_647209</ext-link></td><td align="left">conserved hypothetical protein</td><td align="center">7.48</td><td align="center">3.84E-05</td></tr><tr><td align="left">76.m00146_at</td><td align="left"><ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="XM_648554">XM_648554</ext-link></td><td align="left">hypothetical protein</td><td align="center">7.34</td><td align="center">1.75E-04</td></tr><tr><td align="left">89.m00125_s_at</td><td align="left"><ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="XM_648139">XM_648139</ext-link></td><td align="left">hypothetical protein</td><td align="center">7.32</td><td align="center">2.51E-05</td></tr><tr><td align="left">220.m00068_x_at</td><td align="left"><ext-link ext-link-type="gen" xlink:href="XM_645332">XM_645332</ext-link></td><td align="left">hypothetical p